            "block_content": "standards and procedures) which do not violate an express term of the Collective Bargaining Agreement and which are not arbitrary or capricious. The Employer agrees to issue, in an associates on roll packet, a letter indicating the Collective Bargaining Agreement may contain different provisions than those contained in the Employee Handbook.",
