        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "E. No person shall be discriminated against in regard to hire, tenure of employment or job status by reason of race, color, creed, national origin, age, sex, sexual orientation, medical or mental disabilities as defined in the Americans With Disabilities Act.",
