        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Job openings shall be filled by promotions by seniority, consistent with Section 16 (A), wherever possible and always on a non-discriminatory basis. All permanent openings in higher rated jobs shall be publicized well in advance in order that all employees including minority race employees and female employees may have an opportunity to notify management of their desire to be considered for promotion to a better position or to a higher paying department.",
